<title>UK: Courtaulds names Shanley new finance head.</title>
<headline>Courtaulds names Shanley new finance head.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chemicals group Courtaulds Plc said on Friday it had appointed Patrick Shanley as finance director with effect from June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>Shanley succeeds Howard Evans who will leave the company by mutual agreement on that date, the company said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
